WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,530 --> 00:00:05,570
When has it happened?

2
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:12,830
Electric cars and electricity. Hello, brothers. I want to go in and open it to see what it is.

3
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:15,070
It contains river rice and mineral water, but nothing else.

4
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:16,150
Why do you call it nothing else?

5
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:17,710
This is water and rice

6
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:19,190
But looking at the girl’s demeanor

7
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:25,180
It should be given to the boss. Go in, can you smell it?

8
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:26,220
It smells so good. I never smell it.

9
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:28,100
So fragrant, I'm starving to death

10
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:29,100
The leaders of this bunch of dogs

11
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,220
Damn you'll enjoy it

12
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:35,040
Can't take things out yet

13
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,600
Will cause unnecessary trouble

14
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,120
Xia Boss Xia

15
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:41,900
Is Qin Huang at the base? I'll go call him.

16
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:42,980
Boss Xia, wait for me for a while
